Regarding multiple groups, try putting c() inside of prior() instead of vice versa:

HS.model <- '
 visual  =~ prior(c("dnorm(0,.01)","dnorm(L1,100)"))*x1 +
            prior(c("dnorm(0,.01)","dnorm(L2,100)"))*x2 +
            prior(c("dnorm(0,.01)","dnorm(L3,100)"))*x3
 '

I'm not sure why it is different from other things (Yves added the prior() thing in lavaan), but it seems to work.

Ed

